SMAA: https://github.com/iryoku/smaa
smaa_edge.frag, smaa_blend.frag and smaa_neigh.frag are the morphological
edge, blend-weight and neighbourhood passes, adapted to the Vulkan present
pass. Low, Medium, High and Ultra use the published thresholds and search
steps (4, 8, 16, 32). The blend weights are computed from those search
distances; the original area and search textures are not shipped.
